<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<glyph name="uni0328" format="2">
  <unicode hex="0328"/>
  <note>
Joining ogonek tail. Uses a dedicated _ogonek anchor; selected base join positions are optically placed, never the detached bottom-dot anchor.
Weight master: 正文细体：竖茎压到约 34，横画仍留 26，接合故意重于茎（48）以免尖脚断开。B 的上碗仍小于下碗，腰部反而松开；M 的谷抬高，避免细线收成针尖。e 的横画上移、开口加大。字距明显放松。
</note>
  <anchor x="-75.02421992627657" y="-218.24278385249096" name="bottom"/>
  <anchor x="45" y="0" name="_ogonek"/>
